ease randomly output one of \"[[A]]\", \"[[B]]\", \"[[C]]\", or \"[[D]]\";\n(3) Please only output the most likely answer index based on the given information, and do not output any other content.\n\n[Story]\nSu Qing is a writer, she just finishes her first novel. At the new book launch, Su Qing unexpectedly sees her junior high school math teacher, Teacher Zhang, at the scene.\n\n[Question]\nSu Qing should be surprised at the appearance of Teacher Zhang, but she actually feels very proud. Why is this?\n\n[Candidate Answers]\nA. Teacher Zhang takes pride in Su Qing's success, because he is the source of inspiration for Su Qing's creation.\nB. Su Qing thinks that Teacher Zhang never really believes in her, so her achievement is a silent victory over Teacher Zhang for her.\nC. Teacher Zhang is very strict with Su Qing, but Su Qing knows that Teacher Zhang loves her very much, Teacher Zhang's appearance at the scene shows his approval of Su Qing.\nD. Although Su Qing is not interested in math, she still appreciates the encouragement of Teacher Zhang at that time, which has a positive impact on her writing career","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":2,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.001700690267086002,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6af52b4dc2ddb05a7fe300a8","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794452301927,"createTime":"2026-11-12 10:58:21","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null}],"first":true,"last":true},"nonce":"1cf284c63d5a47ea88d0a3923fe12881"}